 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's a tough one. Sometimes doing something for yourself can be the most meaningful end of the day. No rush. I went with the Rode Procaster. You can use it for that, or outside if it' quiet enough. Start with just a few words. Good memory. No problem. Still thinking about your dad. Could be surprise lunch for co-workers, or going for a bike ride he hasn't tried yet. Then look at the older vintage classics, resistance you can feel through gloves. Pick him up on store day if you can, so he doesn't have to carry it.",
